        "created_at": "2014-02-07T14:48:24.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The only instances I can think of off the top of my head:</p><p>At the Vengeance launch party, a couple of us referred to Christopher being becoming angry as flipped. &nbsp;It was something like \"better watch out, or Christopher will flip to mean Christopher\" or something like that.</p><p>When I was out of commission after my back surgery in December, I did refer to myself as being \"incapped\" once.</p>",
