        "created_at": "2014-02-07T15:20:52.000Z",
        "cooked": "<blockquote><p>\"Good thing he left, one more minute and I would have flipped.\"</p></blockquote><p>I love that. That is fantastic.</p><p>I do refer to people/thing as incapacitated. When the internet goes down I get especially annoyed as it doesn't even have any incapacitated powers. At least when I'm incapacitated, I have game design fever dreams - just ask the playtesters.</p><p>Speaking of playtesting, I refer to threatening banning on playtesters who share data outside the playtesting forum as Christopher on Advanced, so there's that.</p>",
