        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "[quote=\"Blossercubbles\"]\n\nI enjoy Mentally Diverging trash around the store. Does that help?\n\n[/quote]\n\nI can&#39;t think of anything that&#39;s directly on the topic (though I have the feeling I have done something at least once, I just can&#39;t recall the specifics), but I do know that playing Sentinels has permanently branded the spelling of several previously-obscure words, such as &quot;Divergence&quot;, onto my brain.&nbsp; Like Magic the Gathering before it, it has essentially served as a teaching aid in my day-to-day life.\n",
